sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant C as React or Flutter Customer
    participant Y as YARP
    participant D as Delivery API
    participant DB as Delivery DB
    participant R as Delivery outbox relay
    participant B as RabbitMQ
    U->>C: Enter delivery details
    C->>Y: POST /api/v1/quotes (EstimateFee)
    Y->>D: JWT and QuoteInput
    D->>D: Authenticate Customer and validate input and both zones
    alt Missing or invalid credentials
        D-->>C: 401, no quote or parcel
    else Authenticated without Customer role
        D-->>C: 403, no quote or parcel
    else Invalid input
        D-->>C: 400, no quote or parcel
    else Unsupported or inactive zone
        D-->>C: 422, no quote or parcel
    else Valid quote request
        D->>DB: Select tier by deliveryAddress.zoneId, size and version
        Note over D,DB: Pickup zone validated separately, no cross-zone surcharge
        D->>DB: Store full input and owner-bound 10 minute quote
        D-->>C: 200 quoteId total expiresAt
        C-->>U: Preview fee
        alt Customer declines
            U-->>C: Cancel preview
            Note over C,DB: No parcel or delivery event
        else Customer confirms
            C->>Y: POST /api/v1/parcels (CreateParcel) + Idempotency-Key
            Y->>D: quoteId and acceptTotal
            D->>D: Authenticate Customer, validate request and key
            alt Missing or invalid credentials / wrong role / invalid request
                D-->>C: 401 / 403 / 400
            else Valid confirmation request
                D->>DB: Resolve or atomically reserve principal/operation/key
                alt Changed fingerprint / expired retained key / unresolved concurrent request
                    D-->>C: 409 conflict, no second booking
                else Identical committed request within 30 day replay window
                    DB-->>D: Original status, exact body and Location
                    D-->>C: Original 201 response, even if quote expired or consumed
                else New reservation
                    D->>DB: Read owner-bound quote after committed replay check
                    alt Quote missing or belongs to another owner
                        D-->>C: 404, rollback reservation
                    else Quote expired, consumed or accepted total differs
                        D-->>C: 409, rollback reservation
                    else Valid owned quote
                        D->>DB: One transaction: consume quote, Created parcel, snapshot, history, outbox, response
                        DB-->>D: Commit
                        D-->>C: 201 parcel tracking version and Location
                        R->>DB: Read pending StatusChanged
                        R->>B: Publish stable eventId and await confirmation
                        R->>DB: Mark sent after confirmation
                        Note over R,B: Broker outage leaves row pending, duplicate publish is possible
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
